{
  "name": "Quick buttons",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "ViberDock",
  "description": "A row of up to six buttons for Windows' own tools: quick settings, Task view, clipboard history, a screen snip, the notification centre, the desktop, the emoji panel, File Explorer, Settings, Search, the virtual desktops, Cast, Task Manager or Lock. Choose each button in the settings.",
